  "description": "Generate text-to-speech (TTS) markup in Windows applications in Microsoft SAPI 5 XML markup and W3C SSML formats to enhance speech synthesis.\n\nUse VoiceMarkupKit in the Chant Developer Workbench to interactively create, edit, and test TTS markup before deploying with applications and VoiceXML.\n\nDocumentation is available at https://www.chant.net/support/documentation/voicemarkupkit.\n\nSamples are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads.\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires a purchased license for use. Evaluation credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/support/downloads. Purchased licensed credentials are available at https://www.chant.net/store. See https://www.chant.net/products/voicemarkupkit for more information about evaluating and purchasing licenses.",
